D7D7AF][/dim]generated Markdown pages — is rendered in the configured [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`timezone`, never in UTC and never in the host system clock, and a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]repo-wide guard test keeps new UTC/system-clock display sites from [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]landing.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]timezone_display_consistency.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/timezone_display_consistency.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-em[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-em/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared display helpers in sase.core.time[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]helpers[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]helpers: add `parse_local`/`format_local` to `sase.core.time` so every [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]display site has one way to turn a stored timestamp (aware-UTC ISO, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]naive ISO, or epoch) into an aware configured-tz value, plus [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]divergence-fixture unit tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Artifacts tab and artifact CLI[/bold #D7AFFF]                                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]artifacts[dim] · [dim][/dim]after helpers[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]artifacts: fix the Files/Beads/Plans panes, the artifact-ref completion [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]menu, and `sase artifact list` so artifact and bead timestamps render in[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the configured timezone instead of raw UTC.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]ACE modals, tools panel, and file panel[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tui-panels[dim] · [dim][/dim]after helpers[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tui-panels: fix the logs, statistics, project-inventory, tasks, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]saved-group, and roster displays plus the tools and file panel fetch [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]clocks, which currently show UTC or the host system clock.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]CLI tables, generated Markdown pages, and telemetry defaults[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-pages[dim] · [dim][/dim]after helpers[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-pages: fix `sase task`, `sase repo log`, `sase memory log`, `sase [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]skills log`, the agents-sync and bead-page Markdown renderers, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory review TUI, notification-gate debug dumps, and the telemetry [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]render tz defaults.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Artifact-file calendar dates in the configured timezone[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]artifact-dates[dim] · [dim][/dim]after helpers[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]artifact-dates: mint artifact `created_at` and the retention `now` with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the configured-tz offset and make the Rust core bucket calendar dates by[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that embedded offset, so `date:`/`since:` filtering agrees with the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]displayed day.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Repo-wide guard test and documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] 